<p>Berida zainab hai bhaiyya, majma e aghiyaar hai<br />
Shaam ka bazaar hai aur sham ka darbaar hai</p>

<p>Saath mere bas akela abid e beemar hai<br />
Shaam ka bazaar hai aur sham ka darbaar hai</p>

<p>1. Daakhila ahl e haram ka sham me jis dam huwa<br />
Har qadam par sakhtiya thi, aur rone par jafa<br />
Do qadam aise me chalna ab mera dushwaar hai<br />
Shaam ka bazaar hai aur sham ka darbaar hai</p>

<p>2. Haath me patthar liye the sab tamashaayi khadhe<br />
Aur humko maarte the hum rasan basta khadhe<br />
Kya kare zainab battao bekas o laachaar hai<br />
Shaam ka bazaar hai aur sham ka darbaar hai</p>

<p>3. Koobaku humko phirakar aur kehte the shaqi<br />
Ye hai zainab dekhlo ye hai ali ki laadli<br />
Koi kehdo naam na le ye bhara darbaar hai<br />
Shaam ka bazaar hai aur sham ka darbaar hai</p>

<p>4. Hind aati hai sar e zindaan zainab ne suna<br />
Bibiyon mujhko chupaalo roke zainab ne kaha<br />
Ek chaadar bhi humaare paas na darkaar hai<br />
Shaam ka bazaar hai aur sham ka darbaar hai</p>

<p>5. Qaidkhaane me sakina rote rote margayi<br />
Mout meri bachchi ki zakhmon ko taaza kar gayi<br />
Misl e zehra pasliya iski bhi to mismaar hai<br />
Shaam ka bazaar hai aur sham ka darbaar hai</p>

<p>6. Noke naiza se ye aati thi sada shabbier ki<br />
Aye behan tu laaj rakhle maadar e dilgeer ki<br />
Tu bacha apne ali ko wo bada ghamkhwaar hai<br />
Shaam ka bazaar hai aur sham ka darbaar hai</p>

<p>7. Kya qayamat aagayi hai aal e ahmed par <b>Zameer</b><br />
Uski parda daar qaidi jo zamaane ka ameer<br />
Jiske parde ka muhaafiz khud alambardaar hai<br />
Shaam ka bazaar hai aur sham ka darbaar hai</p>

